{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27049","headline":"成名後留别从兄 · 姚合","name":"成名後留别从兄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一辞山舍废躬耕，无事悠悠住帝城。\n爲客衣裳多不稳，和人诗句固难精。\n几年秋赋唯知病，昨日春闱偶有名。\n却出关东悲复喜，归寻弟妹别仁兄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27049.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27049","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}